<title>FRANCE: British child killed in bus crash in France.</title>
<headline>British child killed in bus crash in France.</headline>
<dateline>GRENOBLE, France 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A British child was killed and four others seriously injured when a bus veered off a road in eastern France on Monday, police said.</p>
<p>The bus left the road near the town of Notre-Dame des Pres and fell 20 metres (60 feet). The cause of the accident was not immediately known.</p>
</text>
